<div class='file-block' id='file-1049'>
<div class='file-header'>migrations/0064_add_rum_page_views_path_created_at_index.sql</div>
<pre><code>-- Task E&#x27;s per-path performance breakdown (`RumAnalyticsRepository::
-- slow_pages`) filters by (site_id, created_at range) and groups by
-- path. The existing `idx_rum_page_views_site_path (site_id, path)` from
-- 0062 helps narrow to a site but doesn&#x27;t cover the time-range filter,
