     * `siteKey` (required): the PUBLIC site identifier from the
     * PingVertex dashboard (looks like &quot;rum_&lt;32 hex chars&gt;&quot;). This is
     * NOT a secret — it&#x27;s fine for it to be visible in page source or
     * devtools.
